>fundamentally just </i>jackasses. I actually want to play one of their servants now, screaming &quot;I AM THE LAW (provisional to you oh lord please don't smack me with an emanation)&quot; with dark glory.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Can.... can Arisen... can Arisen be described as lich paladins?<br /> <br /> ...I think I can sell a player on lich paladins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T13:57:59-08:00","id":1346272,"title":"","content":"Argh, I wanted to charge my debit card today so I could back the Kickstarter, but didn't had time.. hopefully that by Thursday I'll get it done. I need my immortals :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T14:02:45-08:00","id":1346274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1346138-mummy-the-curse-2e-kickstarter?p=1346270#post1346270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can.... can Arisen... can Arisen be described as lich paladins?<br /> <br /> ...I think I can sell a player on lich paladins.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, maybe more lich clerics.<br /> <br /> But definitely 'lich divine champions'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T14:32:15-08:00","id":1346285,"title":"","content":"Wasn't expecting Apotheosis, the central mystery throughout the first SAS series and the only escape from the Judges, to turn out to be pointless self deification in 2e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T14:41:19-08:00","id":1346287,"title":"","content":"Thoughts so far. <br /> <br /> I like the book's chapter organization. I know this might seem small but it really matters. This book is organized in a structurally sound, organized, logical manner that has me nodding along where everything is. So I like that. A lot. <br /> <br /> I like the way first two chapters are written, both information wise and style wise. I like the Guilds, both the major and minor and the potential for others, I like the Degrees, they are very nifty. The Judges are there but not there at the same time and I like that. The way that society for the Arisen works is cool too. The mention about other immortlas, including vampires, and why they can and can't fit in is perfect. I also like the nuanced element between The Timeless and The Endless, its brilliant. This is of course in addition to the whole element of time is all weird and non-linear, which I LOVE. <br /> <br /> So so far, with what has been posted, I like it. <br /> <br /> Now I just need to wait (patiently I guess, lol) for the mechanics chapter and then the ST adventuring chapter that is 7, which I really want to see and hope is really really long. I want awesome fun campaign advice. <br /> <br /> So yeah, so far so good. (I backed at the book level as I know myself if I even remotely like most of it then I will want a book to add to my shelf.) *(Heck, I don't even have to like or need all of it, I bought Hunter Witchfinders for the one chapter on Gutter Magic, lol, even though I will never play a Hunter game)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T14:45:16-08:00","id":1346288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1346138-mummy-the-curse-2e-kickstarter?p=1346270#post1346270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Can.... can Arisen... can Arisen be described as lich paladins?<br /> <br /> ...I think I can sell a player on lich paladins.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No.<br /> <br /> The Kher-Minu already have copyright on that.<br /> <br /> (I'm praying that it turns out their programmed bloodthirst doesn't shut down their minds too bad, because they are awesome on toast. Really, all the Minor Guilds are, including the Deceived in that, but the Kher-Minu are the kind of thing that would have their own gameline in another universe.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 11-05-2019, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T15:50:46-08:00","id":1346302,"title":"","content":"I was just thinking how cool it would be if a mummy who has undergone Apotheosis now experiences time like everyone else does (that is one day at a time in order). So let us imagine a campaign where he builds up to apothesis over a bunch of descents but that the one that leads to his actual Apotheosis was say a few thousand years in the past. Now he is a being who is fully awake and aware and experiences time like the Endless.<br /> <br /> It would be an interesting end to a campaign I think. hehe<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> The other option is that upon achieving Apotheosis he gains the ability to control the nature of personal non-linear time. He still has descents its just he gets to choose when they are. In this case he becomes more like the Doctor jumping between times at will. hehe<br /> <br /> Which is also a fun way to have a post-game campaign.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 11-05-2019, 06:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","cu